{"nodes":[{"id":"title","type":"text","text":"# 刘海98种｜五行广义—叙事狭义总索引 v1.2\n\n**完整研究卡：98/98｜参考图：98/98｜重复图：0**\n\n五行是广义父项；五大主题是五行进入叙事领域后的狭义子项。\n\n**五大主题 --is-a狭义[domain=叙事]→ 五行**\n\n[[SKILL.md|五行S级Skill]]　[[00_五大主题与五行_广义狭义具象名词对照表.md|广义—狭义对照表]]\n[[01-十元系统/05-十元语义空间/L1_is-a狭义继承关系协议_v1.0_20260803.md|is-a狭义正本]]\n[[02_图片与结构审计报告.md|结构审计]]　[[04_外链可用性报告.md|外链审计]]","x":-900,"y":-950,"width":1800,"height":820,"color":"4"},{"id":"wood","type":"text","text":"## 木｜zx ↔ nx｜18项\n\n![](https://i0.wp.com/therighthairstyles.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/3-long-blonde-hairstyle-with-beach-waves-and-bangs.jpg?resize=500%2C537&ssl=1)\n\n[[五行库/木/木_zx-nx.canvas|打开木库]]\n\n阳木zx：6｜阴木nx：12\n**因果 --is-a狭义[叙事]→ 木**","x":-1900,"y":0,"width":700,"height":820,"color":"4"},{"id":"fire","type":"text","text":"## 火｜zn ↔ x｜19项\n\n![](https://therighthairstyles.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/10-curtain-bangs-for-curly-hair.jpg)\n\n[[五行库/火/火_zn-x.canvas|打开火库]]\n\n阳火zn：8｜阴火x：11\n**本体 --is-a狭义[叙事]→ 火**","x":-950,"y":0,"width":700,"height":820,"color":"1"},{"id":"earth","type":"text","text":"## 土｜n ↔ x并z｜33项\n\n![](https://i0.wp.com/therighthairstyles.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/5-see-through-korean-bangs.jpg?resize=806%2C953&ssl=1)\n\n[[五行库/土/土_n-x并z.canvas|打开土库]]\n\n阳土n：21｜阴土x并z：12\n**空间 --is-a狭义[叙事]→ 土**","x":0,"y":0,"width":700,"height":820,"color":"6"},{"id":"metal","type":"text","text":"## 金｜xn ↔ z｜18项\n\n![](https://www.byrdie.com/thmb/9847xSR6Q27uSbjVbFfvbQGJwJA%3D/1500x0/filters%3Ano_upscale%28%29%3Amax_bytes%28150000%29%3Astrip_icc%28%29%3Aformat%28webp%29/megan-664f89de405b4cd189a603b727900d26.jpg)\n\n[[五行库/金/金_xn-z.canvas|打开金库]]\n\n阳金xn：11｜阴金z：7\n**时间 --is-a狭义[叙事]→ 金**","x":950,"y":0,"width":700,"height":820,"color":"5"},{"id":"water","type":"text","text":"## 水｜xz ↔ nz｜10项\n\n![](https://i0.wp.com/therighthairstyles.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/4-wispy-korean-bangs.jpg?resize=830%2C1032&ssl=1)\n\n[[五行库/水/水_xz-nz.canvas|打开水库]]\n\n阳水xz：9｜阴水nz：1\n**命运 --is-a狭义[叙事]→ 水**","x":1900,"y":0,"width":700,"height":820,"color":"2"},{"id":"rules","type":"text","text":"## 当前正本口径\n\n1. 五行是广义父项。\n2. 五大主题是叙事领域狭义子项。\n3. 每张卡保存 child、parent、domain=叙事。\n4. 狭义主题继承五行轴，但不等于父项全部外延。\n5. 具体作品主题使用 instance-of，不替代 is-a狭义。\n6. 冻结目录含17个实际文件副本。\n7. 自动构建阻止漏项、缺图、冲突标记和层级退化。","x":-950,"y":1080,"width":1900,"height":700,"color":"3"}],"edges":[{"id":"e1","fromNode":"title","toNode":"wood"},{"id":"e2","fromNode":"title","toNode":"fire"},{"id":"e3","fromNode":"title","toNode":"earth"},{"id":"e4","fromNode":"title","toNode":"metal"},{"id":"e5","fromNode":"title","toNode":"water"},{"id":"e6","fromNode":"earth","toNode":"rules"}],"metadata":{"version":"1.0-1.0","frontmatter":{}}}